   "text": "Kaplan International College Adelaide - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nKaplan International College Adelaide\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Adelaide is located in South Australia and was established in 1874. It is the third-oldest university in Australia. \nThe university is associated with five Nobel Laureates, constituting one-third of Australia's total, and 110 Rhodes scholars.The university has had a considerable impact on the public life of South Australia, having educated many of the state's leading businesspeople, lawyers, medical professionals and politicians. The university has been associated with many notable achievements and discoveries, such as the discovery and development of penicillin.\nOn the pathway program, students are given guaranteed entry to their degree of choice at the University of Adelaide, with no further English language requirement on successful completion.\nThe College is located in the Central Business District of Adelaide, a short stroll from the University of Adelaide’s main campus.\nCRICOS Provider Code: 03127E.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n04/05/2026 06:12\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:38\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$46,950.00\nMin: A$17,600.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n22%\n3,250 of 15,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1874\nCampus(es)\nAdelaide \nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nPakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n15/04/2026\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s