   "text": "Kaplan International College Adelaide - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nKaplan International College Adelaide\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nList of Testimonials\nSearch Institution Testimonials\nSEARCH\nMANAGE FILTERS\nREFRESH\n2 items available\nSorted by {0} descending\nColumn headers with buttons are sortable\nImage\n\t\nStudent Name\n\t\nComment\n\t\nCreated\n\t\nShane Lee from Malaysia\nFoundation Studies progressing to Bachelor's of Engineering (Honors) (Petroleum) and Bachelor's of Science\n\t\n\"If I were to have gone straight to the University of Adelaide without doing the Foundation Studies Program, I would have encountered a lot of difficulties with the weight of expectation.\" One thing I really liked about my teachers is how they commun....Show More\n\t\nNov 9, 2020\nData Migration\n\t\nLily Liviani from Indonesia\nFoundation Studies progressing to Bachelor's of Commerce (International Business) and Bachelor's of Law\n\t\nMy aunty had studied at the University of Adelaide previously and spoke very highly of her educational experience, saying that it was an excellent environment for international students. I didn’t study Law at the College, but now I am doing Law along....Show More\n\t\nNov 9, 2020\nData Migration",
